      "author": "Jackyun6",
      "description": "## KnowStruct 0.5.0\r\n\r\nInitial community release of KnowStruct for Obsidian.\r\n\r\n### Highlights\r\n\r\n- Knowledge projects with separate document, card, mind-map, and review workflows\r\n- Editable Markdown content cards and Q&A cards\r\n- Native Canvas mind maps with title-only collapsed nodes and full-content expanded nodes\r\n- Spaced review for both card types\r\n- Image and PDF conversion through MinerU cloud, Agent, and local API modes\r\n- Migration from the legacy Cards, Imports, and Maps directory layout\r\n\r\n### Installation\r\n\r\nDownload main.js, manifest.json, and styles.css from the assets below, or install KnowStruct from Obsidian Community Plugins after approval.",
